  "worked_solution": "We can combine the two $\\sqrt{xy}$ terms together, but we cannot combine $\\sqrt{xy}$ and $\\sqrt[3]{xy}$ term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2\\sqrt[3]{xy}-4\\sqrt{xy}+6\\sqrt{xy} & = \\\\ -2\\sqrt[3]{xy}+(-4+6)\\sqrt{xy} & = \\\\ -2\\sqrt[3]{xy}+2\\sqrt{xy} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
